        <body>
            <div xml:id="d824">

                <pb facs="0970" n="876" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg876"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-12-25"><hi rendition="#italic">December 25, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received Jan. 8, 1897.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1118.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith the
                    copy of my letter to the Rev. H. O. Dwight of the 23d instant, and his answer
                    thereto of the 24th instant, which refer to his knowledge about the closing of
                    mission schools. I have sent like inquiries direct to all the school stations in
                    Turkey. The answers I hope to transmit before leaving this post.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d824-a1.xml" xpointer="d824-a1"/>
